== Notes ==
* The fear duration is 4 rounds.
* While the in-game description of this spell lists "mind-affecting" and "sonic" as descriptors, the saving throw is made versus "fear".
* This is the only spell for which [[BioWare]] did not provide a [[scroll]] in the standard game resources.
*For the crafting feats ([[brew potion|potions]], [[craft wand|wands]], and [[scribe scroll|scrolls]]) and for [[use magic device]] checks, this spell is treated as having an innate level of 3.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''silence'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

=== Previous versions ===
* Prior to 1.69, this spell did not have a somatic component, so it could be cast while wearing full armor and shield, ignoring arcane [[spell failure]].

